But you definitely do not have "a default hardware".  Radeon 7500
is really not supported by anything below 4.2.0 version of XFree86.
You can find compiled rpms for that in Red Hat "rawhide" but you will
need quite a few updates before this will have a chance to work.

BTW - this card requires

